# Never commit the store, the FinTS state, or anything credential-bearing.
# The real files live OUTSIDE the repo (~/.hermes/finance/) — these patterns
# are a second line of defence against a stray copy or a test run pointed at
# the working tree.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
finance.db
fints_state.json
fints_state.json.lock
*.lock
*.tmp
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
